               ----------------------------------
                Artillery for the Psion Series 3  
               ----------------------------------

         Copy the files ARTILLRY.OPO to OPO directory
                        ARTILLRY.PIC to OPD directory

             And then run from under the OPL icon

   --------------------------------------------------------

	Features:   6 types of landscapes
                    Variable Wind and Gravity
	            Up to 16 players (human or computer)
                    Simultaneous Firing
        
  ----------------------------------------------------------

           Program written by A.Baldwin (C) 1993 

                    Freely Distributable
 
